{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは田村真佑です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんな、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わたし、、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんと、、、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Idios_1st LIVEにちょっぴり出演させていただきました〜っ！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ええーーー！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夢みたいだよ。本当に、、。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "只々にじさんじさんが好きで\nそれをファンの皆さんと共有してただけの私が、五十嵐梨花さんの本気チャレンジにゲストとして呼んでいただけたんだよっ！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "好きって気持ちがこうやって繋がっていくの\n嬉しいな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "正直すごく緊張してたのですが\n五十嵐梨花さん、、いや、、、！\nりかしぃがとにかくひたすらに優しくて可愛くて、ニヤけるのを必死に我慢してました。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "我慢出来てはなかったですけど努力はしたよ。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202511/mobCdTcZ8.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "きっと私のファンのみんなは私と同じくらい喜んでくれたんじゃないかな〜？？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "はやく皆んなに\nいいだろ〜！！って直接自慢したいな〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "へへへ☺️"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "LIVEのセトリも良すぎて\nもうずっとワクワクが止まらなかったです🫧\nみんな歌もダンスも上手で私ももっとパフォーマンス頑張らないとな〜ってエネルギーをたくさんもらいました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202511/mobqTMmth.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "しかもね、\n一緒にダンス動画も撮らせていただきました🦭"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こいのね!ダンス動画↓\nhttps://youtube.com/shorts/fkRUo457smU"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "君と猫ダンス動画↓\nhttps://vt.tiktok.com/ZSyHan8Dy/"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "みんな！！私！りかしぃと踊ったよー！！\n君と猫踊ってくれてるの、、\n夢みたいです🫧"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しすぎて既に何回もみているのですが、\nまだみてないよ〜っ！方がいたら\n是非是非！！みてください！！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "嬉しさが溢れていつもよりも\nびっくりマーク多めだけど許して。"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "LIVEの企画内では五十嵐梨花さんと一緒に\n相性×優勝ドロップス\nを踊らせていただいてます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当にIdiosさんの楽曲が良すぎて\nダンス覚えるの楽しかったよ⚾️🧡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202511/mobRijzSM.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最高の思い出になりました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202511/mobGx0a3F.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Instagramに写真を載せたから\nのぞいてみてね〜🐱\nメロい田村がみれるぞ〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後まで読んでくれてありがとう〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね"}], "source": "official"}